# Dockerfile-specific ignore policy for backend/Dockerfile.
# Build context is the repository root, but the API builder needs ONLY the C17
# engine and Rust backend. Do not send legacy Python, the frontend, local data,
# account secrets or unrelated infrastructure into this build context.
# Dockerfile-specific ignore files take precedence over root .dockerignore.
**
!backend
!backend/**
!imgengine
!imgengine/**

# Security exclusions remain in effect even inside permitted source trees.
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.ssh
**/data
**/target
**/build
**/build-*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/*.log
**/*.profraw
**/*.profdata
